  "text": "Skip to content\nLocal preview\nDraft content · 9 October 2026\nartifactory.\nProjects\nInvestors\nOur approach\nAbout\nEN\n/\nPL\nLet’s talk\nHome\nAbout\n\nABOUT ARTIFACTORY\n\nCuriosity, translated into engineering.\n\nArtifactory is the company behind the ArtiSense and AIFIELD project directions: sensing technology and tools for designing photonic systems.\n\nARTIFACTORY / 01\nPHOTONICS\nSIGNAL\nLIGHT\nFROM POSSIBILITY TO LIGHT\nConceptual illustration · not a product image or measured result\n\nOUR FOCUS\n\nWorking with the possibilities of light.\n\nLight is central to both project directions. ArtiSense investigates how an optical response can inform chemical measurement. AIFIELD explores the engineering tools used to design and simulate photonic systems.\n\nThe company story brings these related efforts together. Each keeps its own development stage, limitations and validation needs.\n\nProjects\n01 / PEOPLE\nMeet the work first.\n\nA current company team roster, biographies and approved portraits were not supplied for this draft. We have not inferred company roles from project descriptions. Start a conversation to ask about the people and expertise behind each direction.\n\nContact the company\n02 / COMPANY CONTEXT\nA company-level conversation.\n\nInvestment enquiries concern Artifactory as a company. Current legal identity, leadership roles, ownership and IP statements require confirmation before public release. This local edition makes no unverified claims about those details.\n\nInvestors\n\nTHE NEXT CONVERSATION\n\nLet’s explore what\ncomes next.\n\nInvest in the company. Explore the science. Bring a question worth working on.\n\nDiscuss an investment\nExplore partnerships\nartifactory.\n\nEngineering light. Creating possibility.\n\nSensing technology and tools for designing photonic systems.\nProjects\nAll projects\nArtiSense\nAIFIELD\nCompany\nHome\nInvestors\nOur approach\nAbout\nPartnerships\nGet in touch\ninfo@artifactory.tech\nContact\nPrivacy\nArtifactory · 2026\nLocal review edition. Content and Polish translations await owner review.\nBack to top ↑",
